  "ui_hues": {
    "$comment": "Mantine hue names a dashboard's chrome uses (KPI icons, section/tab colours, filter accents), re-drawn in the active palette inside a dashboard. slot = categorical slot (marque order: 0 violet, 1 orange, 2 teal, 3 pink, 4 blue, 5 gold, 6 green, 7 brick); dL / dC / dh = OKLCH nudge (hue shifts survive the text-contrast deepening, lightness shifts may not) that keeps a Mantine pair (violet/grape, blue/indigo, teal/cyan, green/lime) visibly apart. gray, dark, black, white and brandPrimary are never remapped. A palette whose slots run in another hue order lists its own entries under per_palette.",
    "default": {
      "violet": {
        "slot": 0
      },
      "grape": {
        "slot": 0,
        "dh": 25
      },
      "blue": {
        "slot": 4
      },
      "indigo": {
        "slot": 4,
